# Paste into ~/.ssh/config (or scope to a Host block for your lzmx
# hosts). Declares a dead link within ~15 s instead of hanging until a
# manual `Enter ~ .`. Values this aggressive would be annoying for
# plain ssh — with lzmx on the other end they are free: disconnection
# just detaches the session, and reattach restores the screen.
#
# lzmx deliberately sets no such policy on the ssh it execs for
# `attach name@host`: a command-line -o would silently override this
# file, and the transport's patience is your call, not the session
# manager's.
Host *
    ServerAliveInterval 5
    ServerAliveCountMax 3
